WEBVTT

00:02:59.204 --> 00:03:02.413
But that's why Landback
is not about Indigenous people

00:03:02.413 --> 00:03:04.329
trying to run a real estate scam.

00:03:04.788 --> 00:03:05.996
We're doing this

00:03:06.038 --> 00:03:08.329
because the land itself is in crisis.

00:03:08.954 --> 00:03:10.954
Every Indigenous culture is unique,

00:03:10.996 --> 00:03:13.788
but our shared philosophy
is that we come from the land

00:03:13.829 --> 00:03:15.788
and the land is what sustains us.

00:03:15.788 --> 00:03:19.163
And therefore we have
a responsibility to care for it.

00:03:20.371 --> 00:03:27.038
(Applause)

00:03:27.538 --> 00:03:31.704
Landback is about reasserting
Indigenous relationships with the land.